    "root_limit_iff_spectralNorm": "{n : \u2115} (X L : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin n) \u2102) : Filter.Tendsto (rootSequence X) Filter.atTop (\ud835\udcdd L) \u2194 Filter.Tendsto (fun r => spectralNorm (rootSequence X r - L)) Filter.atTop (\ud835\udcdd (0 : \u211d))",
