    "counterexample": ": maximalModulus witnessA = witnessA \u2227 maximalModulus witnessB = (5 / 12 : \u2102) \u2022 1 \u2227 maximalModulus (witnessA + witnessB) = (13 / 12 : \u2102) \u2022 1 \u2227 (maximalModulus (witnessA + witnessB)).trace = (13 / 6 : \u2102) \u2227 \u2200 U V : Matrix.unitaryGroup (Fin 2) \u2102, (unitaryConjugate U (maximalModulus witnessA) + unitaryConjugate V (maximalModulus witnessB)).trace = (11 / 6 : \u2102) \u2227 (unitaryConjugate U (maximalModulus witnessA) + unitaryConjugate V (maximalModulus witnessB) - maximalModulus (witnessA + witnessB)).trace = (-1 / 3 : \u2102) \u2227 \u00ac (maximalModulus (witnessA + witnessB) \u2264 unitaryConjugate U (maximalModulus witnessA) + unitaryConjugate V (maximalModulus witnessB))",
